        <Text>
          <style>Title</style>
          <text>Audio v0.08 - original 3.x bends with LV</text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
          <style>Subtitle</style>
          <size>10</size>
          <text>Modern FluidSynth: opening C rises a whole step; E bends and returns. Both keep their final pitches.
G stays unbent. A second C bends while the first rings; later A tests channel reuse.
Stop/seek during a hold; compare live playback, WAV and MIDI export. These are original 3.x bends.</text>
        </Text>
